<task id="004" project="spaarkeai-compose-r4">
  <metadata>
    <title>Round-trip byte-diff harness — load → no-op save → byte-diff untouched subtrees (NFR-01)</title>
    <phase>0 Gate</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Through-the-wire seam-slice harness (`tests/integration/seam/**`) that is the NFR-01 acceptance verifier + the hard-replace safety net; a test-modifying task under ADR-038 — FULL unconditionally.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>A well-specified harness against a defined byte-identity assertion and a fixed corpus; mechanical OOXML-package traversal, no architectural judgment.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>W0b</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Separate code (harness under tests/integration/seam/Compose/) from task 005 (throwaway spike); both run in wave W0b.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>002</deps>
    <tags>testing,docx,integration-test</tags>
    <estimated-effort>1-2 days</estimated-effort>
